"Dr Mundo": A solid has a definite shape and a definite volume.

"Dr Mundo": A liquid has a definite volume, but it takes the shape of its container.

"Dr Mundo": A gas has neither a definite shape nor a definite volume.

"Dr Mundo": I don't want you to simply memorize these definitions.

